  "//": "Wires the ALLOWED_HOOKS set (21 events — the row-promoted lifecycle hooks the bar-hook binary accepts, see crates/bar-hook ALLOWED_HOOKS/REGISTERED_HOOKS) to `bar-hook`, resolved via PATH. Generated by bar_hook::plugin_hooks_json() — never hand-edit, regenerate instead; tests/plugin_drift.rs fails the build on drift. The binary takes the event name as argv[1]. PATH (not a bundled ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/ binary) is deliberate until a release pipeline bundles per-platform binaries into the plugin zip -- `cargo install bar-hook` puts it on PATH today; a hook command Claude Code can't resolve fails harmlessly and never blocks a session.",
